text Descending down to the first floor, I stand before the door of the reference room and sneakily peek inside.
text A female student is sitting on a chair, reading a book.
text It doesn't take her long to notice my presence. She raises her head to look at me and then says "Welcome" with a smile.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text It doesn't look like she'll just go back to her book. Helplessly, I walk inside.
