text Once she sees that I'm drinking the coffee, Miyazawa finally picks up her book again.
text I wonder what kind of book she's reading...
text Why wouldn't I? This place is like the storehouse of books normal students never touch.
text Stuff like ridiculously complicated technical books... Is that what she's reading right now?
