label s3
text She reminds me of that girl I met in the library.
text I wonder if being a bookworm could make a person so different...
text Well, she's the kind who stays in a place like this all by herself. It wouldn't surprise me even if she's got a totally out-of-the-norm perception of things.
goto 5
label 4
if intF[404] == 0
	goto s4
fi
goto 5
label s4
text She's the kind who stays in a place like this. Her perception of things must be totally out of the norm.
label 5
text As the thought floats up in my mind, I suddenly feel an invisible barrier standing between us.
text You can find people like her everywhere in this school.
text There's something fundamentally different between them and the likes of Sunohara and me, who only read manga and magazines.
